# Import / Library Map

Scanned service-by-service. Each service lists external (npm) packages first, then internal/relative module imports found in its source files.

## frontend (Next.js app)

External packages:
- `next` — framework (App Router, `next/link`, `next/navigation`, `next/image`)
- `react` — `createContext`, `useContext`, `useEffect`, `useState`, `useCallback`, `useRef`, `useMemo`, `ReactNode`
- `react-dom`
- `qrcode.react` — `QRCodeSVG` (wallet address QR rendering in WalletManager)
- `@tailwindcss/postcss`, `tailwindcss` — styling pipeline
- `typescript`, `eslint`, `eslint-config-next`, `@types/node`, `@types/react`, `@types/react-dom` — tooling/types only

Internal imports:
- `@/components/Nav`, `@/components/Cursor`, `@/components/Providers`, `@/components/Footer`
- `@/lib/auth` — `AuthProvider`, `useAuth`
- `@/lib/api` — `useApiFetch`
- `@/lib/poolConfigs.json` — static pool config data
- `./components/Launchpad`, `./components/WalletManager`, `./components/Liquidity`, `./components/Settings` (transit page)
- local asset import: `../images/spectreLinkOfficial.png`

